      "id": "2073982503787143545",
      "text": "I’m currently running gpt 5.5, fable 5, composer 2.5, Gemini 3.5, Hermes, OpenClaw, and a couple other models + agents\n\nEvery agent has different roles in the system and sometimes they overlap but they communicate and work as a team",
