      "id": "2073981765354684425",
      "text": "THIS GUY JUST SHARED HOW TO COPY CLAUDE FABLE 5 BEFORE IT DISAPPEARS AGAIN.\n\nThe goal isn't to clone the model.\n\nIt's to capture how it solves problems, distill that reasoning into a smaller open model, and run it locally.\n\nThe surprising part is that distillation transfers reasoning patterns, not frontier-level intelligence.\n\nBookmark this before it's gone.\n\nRead the breakdown, then check the article below.",
